OL,3,ACall for partial curfews across France
OL,4,Aafter protests as Vinted says it's
OL,5,Aremoving looted items
OL,6,
OL,7,FFrench cities have been given the power
OL,8,Fto implement partial curfews, says PM
OL,9,FSebastien Lecornu
OL,11,FNorthern cities, including Lille, will
OL,12,Fimpose a partial curfew on Monday
OL,13,Fevening, local media reports
OL,15,FIt comes after a weekend of riots and
OL,16,Flooting, with Lecornu saying "we will
OL,17,Fnot be dictated and ruled by the
OL,18,Fbreakers, by the thieves, by the thugs"
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
